@startuml F0.1-a-login-happy-path
title F0.1-a — Login happy path (US-F0-001)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
skinparam noteFontSize 11
autonumber

actor "Usuário" as Usuario
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "AuthController" as AuthController
participant "LoginUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Usuario -> WebApp: identificador + senha / Entrar
WebApp -> AuthController: POST /auth/login\n{identificador, senha}
AuthController -> UC: execute(identificador, senha, ip)

note right of UC
  Normaliza identificador
  (e-mail @ufpr.br, pessoal ou GRR)
  RN-F0.1-01
end note

UC -> Postgres: SELECT usuario BY identificador
Postgres --> UC: usuario\n(ativo, senha_alterada=true)

UC -> UC: Argon2id.verify(senha, senha_hash)\nRN-F0.1-02

UC -> Postgres: UPDATE usuario\nINSERT refresh_token\nINSERT audit_log (iam.login_success)
note right of UC
  Emite JWT RS256 (TTL 15 min)
  + refresh opaco (sessão)
end note
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)

UC --> AuthController: LoginResult\n(accessToken, refresh, mustChangePassword=false)
AuthController --> WebApp: 200 OK\nSet-Cookie so2_refresh\n(httpOnly; Secure; SameSite=Lax)\n+ body accessToken

note right of WebApp
  accessToken só em memória
  refresh no cookie
  RN-F0.1-03
end note

WebApp --> Usuario: redireciona /inicio

@enduml
